HB0189 Harmful communication-minors.
Sponsored By: Representative(s) Lien, Angelos, Brady, Lawley,
Lucas, Washut, Webb and Webber and Senator(s) Pearson
AN ACT relating to crimes and offenses; prohibiting adults from communicating
with minors about sexual activity as specified; providing penalties; providing
definitions; making conforming amendments; creating a cause of action;
specifying applicability; and providing for an effective date.
1/14/2025 Bill Number Assigned
